    "rate_design_equation": "With promptly accounted paid rate c, refill r<c and initial 2.0 CPU seconds, reaching below 0.1 requires more than 1.9/(c-r) seconds, excluding discard/overrun. At c=.25, r=.125 this exceeds 15.2 seconds, potentially after the t=1/5/9 rounds; this is design arithmetic, not empirical throughput."
